      "id": 1698722938935,
      "title": "Customised Sampler Pack",
      "handle": "customised-sampler-pack",
      "body_html": "<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW211094443 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">Our assorted sampler pack is for those who want to try </span></span><span class=\"TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">our</span></span></span><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> </span><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">coffee beans</span></strong></span><span class=\"TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">, wheth</span></span></span><span class=\"TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">er as</span></span></span><span class=\"TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> whole beans or <strong>ground coffee</strong>,</span></span></span><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> but </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">don't</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> know where to start. This customizable mixed bag of coffee beans allows you to choose between three different coffees to discover which ones work best for you.</span></span><span data-ccp-props='{\"201341983\":0,\"335559739\":160,\"335559740\":279}' class=\"EOP SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> </span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW211094443 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW211094443 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW211094443 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">Each Sampler Pack will </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\">contain</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> 75 g x 3 pouches.</span></span><span data-ccp-props='{\"201341983\":0,\"335559739\":160,\"335559740\":279}' class=\"EOP SCXW211094443 BCX0\"> </span></p>\n</div>",
